title: "FluxMMM and RegretSet-MMM: Decision-Focused Selection of Bayesian Marketing Mix Models"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bramao
    given-names: Gustavo
version: 3.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-05
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/gustavobramao/fluxmmm"
