abstract: >-
  A local-first marketing mix modeling workflow and frozen set-wise research
  selector that learns from truth-blind posterior, evidence, validation, and
  model-contract tokens to reduce downstream economic decision regret.
keywords:
  - marketing mix modeling
  - Bayesian calibration
  - causal inference
  - posterior sampling
  - media optimization
  - decision-focused learning
  - economic regret
  - variational inference
